 ],
 "text": "He returned to the access records from before the activation. The unidentified connection had appeared and disappeared. Security history had been cleaned. His credentials had been revoked.\n\nSomeone had entered TOMBS remotely.\n\nSomeone had selected the settlement.\n\nSomeone had chosen a scale.\n\nAnd whoever had done it had known enough about the island to draw the boundary around the systems keeping forty-three people alive.\n\nJack opened the raw command archive."
